From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Mower <mdmower@cmphys.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:30:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [bugs #4252] Use the installed names of the mcs51 library
 directories

Since r17128, the rules in device/lib/Makefile.in build the mcs51
libraries in build/mcs51-small, build/mcs51-large, and the directories
of the other models, and the install rule copies these directories to
<datadir>/sdcc/lib. get_model() still returned the names without the
prefix, such as small and large-stack-auto. setLibPath() appends that
name to each library path, so sdcc gave the linker lib/small or
lib/large, which make install does not create. The linker did not find
mcs51.lib, and a program linked only when -L named the directory.

The names in models[] now have the prefix mcs51-. The directory that
sdcc searches below $SDCC_LIB has the prefix too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/mcs51/main.c | 10 ++++++----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/mcs51/main.c b/src/mcs51/main.c
index bd60bdecc..11c59e3c8 100644
--- a/src/mcs51/main.c
+++ b/src/mcs51/main.c
@@ -973,12 +973,14 @@ getRegsWritten (lineNode *line)
   return line->aln->regsWritten;
 }
 
+/* The names of the library directories. The rules in device/lib/Makefile.in
+   build and install the libraries under these names. */
 static const char * models[] =
 {
-  "small",  "small-xstack",  "small-stack-auto",  "small-xstack-auto",
-  "medium", "medium-xstack", "medium-stack-auto", "medium-xstack-auto",
-  "large",  "large-xstack",  "large-stack-auto",  "large-xstack-auto",
-  "huge",   "huge-xstack",   "huge-stack-auto",   "huge-xstack-auto",
+  "mcs51-small",  "mcs51-small-xstack",  "mcs51-small-stack-auto",  "mcs51-small-xstack-auto",
+  "mcs51-medium", "mcs51-medium-xstack", "mcs51-medium-stack-auto", "mcs51-medium-xstack-auto",
+  "mcs51-large",  "mcs51-large-xstack",  "mcs51-large-stack-auto",  "mcs51-large-xstack-auto",
+  "mcs51-huge",   "mcs51-huge-xstack",   "mcs51-huge-stack-auto",   "mcs51-huge-xstack-auto",
 };
 
 static const char *
